{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415509","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415509","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041550901:1":{"text":"이곳의 배치는... 센스가 넘치네요.","source_cn":"你们这里的布置……很有设计感啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88D946BC1C1AA095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041550902:1":{"text":"오색 비단의 컬러 조합, 그리고 무늬는 밖에 있는 불꽃과 맞춘 건가요?","source_cn":"彩缎的颜色搭配，还有这里的花样，是呼应了外面的焰火吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1398CE78D7F4784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041550903:1":{"text":"음, 디자인에 대한 아이디어는 잘 모르겠지만 돌리 양에겐 늘 여러 가지 아이디어가 있었어요!","source_cn":"唔，设计思路我是不清楚啦，但多莉小姐一直很有搭配的想法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55CC5E390D92CF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041550904:1":{"text":"로완, 이번 봄빛 축제의 장식이 마음에 드나요?","source_cn":"罗万喜欢这次的春焰庆装饰吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C3BAD27353FBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041550905:1":{"text":"네, 이 등롱이 특히나 마음에 드네요.","source_cn":"嗯，尤其喜欢这些灯笼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404B392AC30FD91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041550906:1":{"text":"골드 같은 모양이니, 그 어떤 상인도 간과할 수 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"犹如金币一般的造型，无论是哪个商人都不会忽视吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306C5D766F8E4973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041550907:1":{"text":"조금 있다가 제가 가서 외부 판매를 허가해 줄 수는 없는지 물어보도록 할게요. 분명 잘 팔릴 거예요.","source_cn":"等一会儿我要去问问，能不能授权给我在外零售，想必销路会不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A1F4708111DC10D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041550908:1":{"text":"로완의 상업적 관점은 여전히 날카롭네요!","source_cn":"罗万的商业视角还是一样这么敏锐呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD6A12ECE58BCD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}